<title>RUSSIA: Russia Sept crude oil output down 3 percent on Aug.</title>
<headline>Russia Sept crude oil output down 3 percent on Aug.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian crude oil output in September fell three percent on August's level and was one percent below year-ago levels, State Statistics Committee figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following data for energy production:</p>
<p>		   Jan-Sept 1996 output:     Sept 1996 output</p>
<p>		  in million     yr/yr	 mth/mth pct   yr/yr pct</p>
<p>		    tonnes   percent change   change	 change</p>
<p> Crude oil	  220	   -2		 -3	   -1</p>
<p> Refined oil	133	   -5		 -0.6	 -4</p>
<p> Gasoline	    20.2	 -5		 -7	  -11</p>
<p> Diesel		35.2	 -3		 -4	   -6</p>
<p> Heavy fuel oil    47.4	 -4		 +6	   -1</p>
<p>(mazut)</p>
<p> Lubricants	   1.8	 -7		-14	  -19</p>
<p> Natural gas	421	   +1		 +5	   +2</p>
<p>(billion cubic</p>
<p>metres)</p>
<p> Gas condensate     6.2	 -0.7	    -10	   -7</p>
<p>The committee gave no absolute figures for monthly output.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
